        "description": "President Trump says he pushed Nvidia to bring Jensen Huang back as CEO, raising questions about why the White House is getting involved in who runs a private company. Nvidia gained nearly a trillion dollars in value after Huang returned, showing how much of the A-I economy is tied to one company and one man. Russia’s war in Ukraine is spreading far beyond the battlefield, even as the Trump administration says talks toward a peace deal are making progress.",
